{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Remain Neutral In Foreign Conflicts.",
        "additional_details": "We think the world is entering a new phase of global tension, with increasing confrontations between major powers. In our view, the UK is at risk of becoming entangled in these geopolitical conflicts. We propose a neutral stance that we think could prioritise British security, protect our economy: allow Britain to serve as a mediator, promoting diplomacy and peace on the international stage.\r\n\r\nWe think Britain is no longer a super power on the level of America, China, or Russia.",
        "background": "We demand the government declare Britain a neutral state. We believe that neutrality will protect British interests, safeguard our national security and uphold our tradition of diplomacy and peacekeeping in an increasingly polarised world.",
